    <item>
      <title>【学生优惠】阿里云免费薅2核2G服务器教程</title>
      <link>https://linux.do/t/topic/2424038</link>
      <guid>linux.do-topic-2424038</guid>
      <pubDate>Wed, 17 Jun 2026 12:20:20 GMT</pubDate>
      <description>
            &lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;首先打开阿里云的学生优惠页面&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://university.aliyun.com&quot; rel=&quot;noopener nofollow ugc&quot;&gt;https://university.aliyun.com&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;找到“我是学生”，领取这里的300元抵扣券&lt;br&gt;
&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;lightbox-wrapper&quot;&gt;&lt;a class=&quot;lightbox&quot; href=&quot;https://cdn3.ldstatic.com/original/4X/5/6/a/56a2aae5b23c7511fd28f570cfd64b4812bddc0d.png&quot; data-download-href=&quot;/uploads/short-url/cmpzIAcbDZu9eXtZwD7LJ6FdUoR.png?dl=1&quot; title=&quot;36fc9036217e275094f9347acbace973&quot; rel=&quot;noopener nofollow ugc&quot;&gt;&lt;img src=&quot;https://cdn3.ldstatic.com/optimized/4X/5/6/a/56a2aae5b23c7511fd28f570cfd64b4812bddc0d_2_690x177.png&quot; alt=&quot;36fc9036217e275094f9347acbace973&quot; data-base62-sha1=&quot;cmpzIAcbDZu9eXtZwD7LJ6FdUoR&quot; width=&quot;690&quot; height=&quot;177&quot; srcset=&quot;https://cdn3.ldstatic.com/optimized/4X/5/6/a/56a2aae5b23c7511fd28f570cfd64b4812bddc0d_2_690x177.png, https://cdn3.ldstatic.com/optimized/4X/5/6/a/56a2aae5b23c7511fd28f570cfd64b4812bddc0d_2_1035x265.png 1.5x, https://cdn3.ldstatic.com/optimized/4X/5/6/a/56a2aae5b23c7511fd28f570cfd64b4812bddc0d_2_1380x354.png 2x&quot; data-dominant-color=&quot;ABA8A7&quot;&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;然后进入ECS(自定义配置)购买页面&lt;a href=&quot;https://ecs-buy.aliyun.com/ecs/#/custom/&quot; rel=&quot;noopener nofollow ugc&quot;&gt;https://ecs-buy.aliyun.com/ecs/#/custom/&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;像我这样选择配置：&lt;br&gt;
&lt;strong&gt;关键点:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;
&lt;strong&gt;实例规格：ecs.e-c1m1.large&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;
&lt;strong&gt;流量计费方式：(CDT)按量计费&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;lightbox-wrapper&quot;&gt;&lt;a class=&quot;lightbox&quot; href=&quot;https://cdn3.ldstatic.com/original/4X/e/5/d/e5d9f1ef459738cfe0d0ef477c9621f4bbbbebf6.png&quot; data-download-href=&quot;/uploads/short-url/wNmhIRvjvdU7qVXADSxMxxQAPZA.png?dl=1&quot; title=&quot;2bb5a64c457c9e8204dc0ec9e7e696c2&quot; rel=&quot;noopener nofollow ugc&quot;&gt;&lt;img src=&quot;https://cdn3.ldstatic.com/optimized/4X/e/5/d/e5d9f1ef459738cfe0d0ef477c9621f4bbbbebf6_2_690x373.png&quot; alt=&quot;2bb5a64c457c9e8204dc0ec9e7e696c2&quot; data-base62-sha1=&quot;wNmhIRvjvdU7qVXADSxMxxQAPZA&quot; width=&quot;690&quot; height=&quot;373&quot; srcset=&quot;https://cdn3.ldstatic.com/optimized/4X/e/5/d/e5d9f1ef459738cfe0d0ef477c9621f4bbbbebf6_2_690x373.png, https://cdn3.ldstatic.com/optimized/4X/e/5/d/e5d9f1ef459738cfe0d0ef477c9621f4bbbbebf6_2_1035x559.png 1.5x, https://cdn3.ldstatic.com/optimized/4X/e/5/d/e5d9f1ef459738cfe0d0ef477c9621f4bbbbebf6_2_1380x746.png 2x&quot; data-dominant-color=&quot;F6F6F7&quot;&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;br&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;lightbox-wrapper&quot;&gt;&lt;a class=&quot;lightbox&quot; href=&quot;https://cdn3.ldstatic.com/original/4X/3/a/d/3ad87055f937d927fac10fc221177c2f3edda5d7.png&quot; data-download-href=&quot;/uploads/short-url/8ozpv2Ju6pZYTfO7CEIqmjNbcwf.png?dl=1&quot; title=&quot;806137cf112a3b3964c2791087c35127&quot; rel=&quot;noopener nofollow ugc&quot;&gt;&lt;img src=&quot;https://cdn3.ldstatic.com/optimized/4X/3/a/d/3ad87055f937d927fac10fc221177c2f3edda5d7_2_690x373.png&quot; alt=&quot;806137cf112a3b3964c2791087c35127&quot; data-base62-sha1=&quot;8ozpv2Ju6pZYTfO7CEIqmjNbcwf&quot; width=&quot;690&quot; height=&quot;373&quot; srcset=&quot;https://cdn3.ldstatic.com/optimized/4X/3/a/d/3ad87055f937d927fac10fc221177c2f3edda5d7_2_690x373.png, https://cdn3.ldstatic.com/optimized/4X/3/a/d/3ad87055f937d927fac10fc221177c2f3edda5d7_2_1035x559.png 1.5x, https://cdn3.ldstatic.com/optimized/4X/3/a/d/3ad87055f937d927fac10fc221177c2f3edda5d7_2_1380x746.png 2x&quot; data-dominant-color=&quot;F9F9F9&quot;&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;br&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;lightbox-wrapper&quot;&gt;&lt;a class=&quot;lightbox&quot; href=&quot;https://cdn3.ldstatic.com/original/4X/a/1/a/a1a3af009f57bdc4e772a91411b0c186d8066bcd.png&quot; data-download-href=&quot;/uploads/short-url/n3VyV71IwgJnXN2Tnnhfu2tuzQ9.png?dl=1&quot; title=&quot;5a593a8a7d910bafb383e89920454ffb&quot; rel=&quot;noopener nofollow ugc&quot;&gt;&lt;img src=&quot;https://cdn3.ldstatic.com/optimized/4X/a/1/a/a1a3af009f57bdc4e772a91411b0c186d8066bcd_2_690x373.png&quot; alt=&quot;5a593a8a7d910bafb383e89920454ffb&quot; data-base62-sha1=&quot;n3VyV71IwgJnXN2Tnnhfu2tuzQ9&quot; width=&quot;690&quot; height=&quot;373&quot; srcset=&quot;https://cdn3.ldstatic.com/optimized/4X/a/1/a/a1a3af009f57bdc4e772a91411b0c186d8066bcd_2_690x373.png, https://cdn3.ldstatic.com/optimized/4X/a/1/a/a1a3af009f57bdc4e772a91411b0c186d8066bcd_2_1035x559.png 1.5x, https://cdn3.ldstatic.com/optimized/4X/a/1/a/a1a3af009f57bdc4e772a91411b0c186d8066bcd_2_1380x746.png 2x&quot; data-dominant-color=&quot;F8F8F8&quot;&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;选择正确的话，最后显示的结账金额应为300元以下，结合优惠券可以直接抵扣&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;
&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;lightbox-wrapper&quot;&gt;&lt;a class=&quot;lightbox&quot; href=&quot;https://cdn3.ldstatic.com/original/4X/5/f/a/5fa3714edfb45d192c636b2bc8a13248e8c2c568.png&quot; data-download-href=&quot;/uploads/short-url/dE3x6bXh1HciGYHxVsADCQ5h3p6.png?dl=1&quot; title=&quot;2ba1d6fa25cab6e5a90fb78315463f57&quot; rel=&quot;noopener nofollow ugc&quot;&gt;&lt;img src=&quot;https://cdn3.ldstatic.com/original/4X/5/f/a/5fa3714edfb45d192c636b2bc8a13248e8c2c568.png&quot; alt=&quot;2ba1d6fa25cab6e5a90fb78315463f57&quot; data-base62-sha1=&quot;dE3x6bXh1HciGYHxVsADCQ5h3p6&quot; width=&quot;550&quot; height=&quot;316&quot;&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;楼主这里开启了CDT计费方式，流量按量计费(前20G免费)，挂点不怎么烧流量的小程序还是不错的&lt;br&gt;
&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;lightbox-wrapper&quot;&gt;&lt;a class=&quot;lightbox&quot; href=&quot;https://cdn3.ldstatic.com/original/4X/2/5/2/252fd74a53c07564ffeadf3a4bace02509d598bc.png&quot; data-download-href=&quot;/uploads/short-url/5iYaf8HF5vIMn6LehHMfEPkvzw8.png?dl=1&quot; title=&quot;5f84c16c80b4ced184133863f6ee7860&quot; rel=&quot;noopener nofollow ugc&quot;&gt;&lt;img src=&quot;https://cdn3.ldstatic.com/optimized/4X/2/5/2/252fd74a53c07564ffeadf3a4bace02509d598bc_2_345x500.png&quot; alt=&quot;5f84c16c80b4ced184133863f6ee7860&quot; data-base62-sha1=&quot;5iYaf8HF5vIMn6LehHMfEPkvzw8&quot; width=&quot;345&quot; height=&quot;500&quot; srcset=&quot;https://cdn3.ldstatic.com/optimized/4X/2/5/2/252fd74a53c07564ffeadf3a4bace02509d598bc_2_345x500.png, https://cdn3.ldstatic.com/optimized/4X/2/5/2/252fd74a53c07564ffeadf3a4bace02509d598bc_2_517x750.png 1.5x, https://cdn3.ldstatic.com/optimized/4X/2/5/2/252fd74a53c07564ffeadf3a4bace02509d598bc_2_690x1000.png 2x&quot; data-dominant-color=&quot;F8F7F7&quot;&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;a name=&quot;p-19268706-h-1&quot; class=&quot;anchor&quot; href=&quot;https://linux.do#p-19268706-h-1&quot; aria-label=&quot;标题链接&quot;&gt;&lt;/a&gt;你们也可以像楼主一样设置一些报警规则，防止被打了(我这里设置的不对，感谢各位佬纠正)&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;lightbox-wrapper&quot;&gt;&lt;a class=&quot;lightbox&quot; href=&quot;https://cdn3.ldstatic.com/original/4X/f/b/1/fb12a5767c948eb53d18c2cff232ec95eabb78ae.png&quot; data-download-href=&quot;/uploads/short-url/zP5NgKy5vK6GTwHbbcTx7gLNYl0.png?dl=1&quot; title=&quot;image&quot; rel=&quot;noopener nofollow ugc&quot;&gt;&lt;img src=&quot;https://cdn3.ldstatic.com/optimized/4X/f/b/1/fb12a5767c948eb53d18c2cff232ec95eabb78ae_2_690x492.png&quot; alt=&quot;image&quot; data-base62-sha1=&quot;zP5NgKy5vK6GTwHbbcTx7gLNYl0&quot; width=&quot;690&quot; height=&quot;492&quot; srcset=&quot;https://cdn3.ldstatic.com/optimized/4X/f/b/1/fb12a5767c948eb53d18c2cff232ec95eabb78ae_2_690x492.png, https://cdn3.ldstatic.com/optimized/4X/f/b/1/fb12a5767c948eb53d18c2cff232ec95eabb78ae_2_1035x738.png 1.5x, https://cdn3.ldstatic.com/optimized/4X/f/b/1/fb12a5767c948eb53d18c2cff232ec95eabb78ae_2_1380x984.png 2x&quot; data-dominant-color=&quot;F5F6F7&quot;&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;a name=&quot;p-19268706-h-2&quot; class=&quot;anchor&quot; href=&quot;https://linux.do#p-19268706-h-2&quot; aria-label=&quot;标题链接&quot;&gt;&lt;/a&gt;佬们如遇优惠券不能抵扣的情况，可以换其他的地域试试，楼主当时是买的青岛的&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;a name=&quot;p-19268706-h-10300-3&quot; class=&quot;anchor&quot; href=&quot;https://linux.do#p-19268706-h-10300-3&quot; aria-label=&quot;标题链接&quot;&gt;&lt;/a&gt;我这里账号还有一个10元的优惠券，你们那里只要显示是300元以下就是正常&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;a name=&quot;p-19268706-tmkuan-4&quot; class=&quot;anchor&quot; href=&quot;https://linux.do#p-19268706-tmkuan-4&quot; aria-label=&quot;标题链接&quot;&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;a class=&quot;mention&quot; href=&quot;https://linux.do/u/tmkuan&quot;&gt;@tmkuan&lt;/a&gt; ：用不了券的问题解决了，只要不选择那几个标注了优惠的地区就可以了&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;a name=&quot;p-19268706-tarozero-02h2g200m-6-5&quot; class=&quot;anchor&quot; href=&quot;https://linux.do#p-19268706-tarozero-02h2g200m-6-5&quot; aria-label=&quot;标题链接&quot;&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;a class=&quot;mention&quot; href=&quot;https://linux.do/u/tarozero&quot;&gt;@TaroZero&lt;/a&gt; ：也可以0元购轻量2h2g200M 6个月&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;a name=&quot;p-19268706-aionfatedio-300glm52-6&quot; class=&quot;anchor&quot; href=&quot;https://linux.do#p-19268706-aionfatedio-300glm52-6&quot; aria-label=&quot;标题链接&quot;&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;a class=&quot;mention&quot; href=&quot;https://linux.do/u/aionfatedio&quot;&gt;@aionfatedio&lt;/a&gt; 300块用阿里云百炼也可以，按量收费尝尝GLM5.2滋味吧&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;a name=&quot;p-19268706-httpshelpaliyuncomzhecspublic-bandwidth-7&quot; class=&quot;anchor&quot; href=&quot;https://linux.do#p-19268706-httpshelpaliyuncomzhecspublic-bandwidth-7&quot; aria-label=&quot;标题链接&quot;&gt;&lt;/a&gt;附：&lt;a href=&quot;https://help.aliyun.com/zh/ecs/public-bandwidth&quot; rel=&quot;noopener nofollow ugc&quot;&gt;公网带宽计费规则-阿里云帮助中心&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
            &lt;p&gt;&lt;small&gt;68 个帖子 - 48 位参与者&lt;/small&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
            &lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://linux.do/t/topic/2424038&quot;&gt;阅读完整话题&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
          </description>
    </item>
    <item>
      <title>DeepSeek Free Key - 20260617</title>
      <link>https://linux.do/t/topic/2423929</link>
      <guid>linux.do-topic-2423929</guid>
      <pubDate>Wed, 17 Jun 2026 11:52:53 GMT</pubDate>
      <description>
            &lt;blockquote&gt;
&lt;p&gt;[!info] &lt;a href=&quot;https://2c2ch1u11-share-api-0.hf.space/v1&quot;&gt;https://2c2ch1u11-share-api-0.hf.space/v1&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/blockquote&gt;
&lt;blockquote&gt;
&lt;p&gt;[!info] sk-cb3f3c12406241ee8aca238f01cd18d9&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/blockquote&gt;
&lt;blockquote&gt;
&lt;p&gt;[!warning] 蹬完就关贴，没关就是还能蹬&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/blockquote&gt;
&lt;blockquote&gt;
&lt;p&gt;[!tip] &lt;a href=&quot;https://linux.do/t/topic/1449493&quot; class=&quot;inline-onebox&quot;&gt;DeepSeek V4 API | LDC兑换额度 | 超便宜渠道&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/blockquote&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;a name=&quot;p-19267852-h-1&quot; class=&quot;anchor&quot; href=&quot;https://linux.do#p-19267852-h-1&quot; aria-label=&quot;标题链接&quot;&gt;&lt;/a&gt;本帖使用社区公益推广，符合推广要求。我申明并遵循社区要求的以下内容：&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;我的项目是免费使用的，无收费（变相收费、赞助）部分：&lt;/strong&gt; 是&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;我的帖子已经打上 &lt;a class=&quot;hashtag-cooked&quot; href=&quot;https://linux.do/tag/1515-tag/1515&quot; data-type=&quot;tag&quot; data-slug=&quot;公益推广&quot; data-id=&quot;1515&quot; data-style-type=&quot;icon&quot; data-icon=&quot;tag&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;hashtag-icon-placeholder&quot;&gt;&lt;svg class=&quot;fa d-icon d-icon-square-full svg-icon svg-node&quot;&gt;&lt;use href=&quot;#square-full&quot;&gt;&lt;/use&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;公益推广&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt; 标签：&lt;/strong&gt; 是&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;我的项目属于个人项目，与公司或商业机构无关：&lt;/strong&gt; 是&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;我的项目不存在QQ、TG等群组引流：&lt;/strong&gt; 是&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;我的项目不存在非运营必要的网站引流：&lt;/strong&gt; 是&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;我的项目不存在为他人推广、AFF：&lt;/strong&gt; 是&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;我的项目无关联的商业项目：&lt;/strong&gt; 是&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;我的站点存在登录，并已接入 LINUX DO Connect：&lt;/strong&gt; 是&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;我帖子内的项目介绍，AI生成、润色内容部分已截图发出：&lt;/strong&gt; 是&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;以上选择我承诺是永久有效的，接受社区和佬友监督：&lt;/strong&gt; 是&lt;/li&gt;
